  dialogue:
  - Excuse ME? I hold several key positions on large-scale servers on a multitudinous
    amount of platforms.
  - As THE moderator of these severs, I wield undeniable authority. How dare you
    accuse me of being jobless!
  - Do you realize just how much work I put in on a daily basis? Just how much POWER
    do you think I hold?
  - But alas, a meagre peasant working a mindless minimum-wage "jo~b" couldn't begin
    to even comprehend.
